vare il coraggio di condividere l'esperienza di Colton.","tagline":"Svela il mistero"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"After their young son, Colton, undergoes emergency surgery, small-town parents Todd and Sonja Burpo are overjoyed at the child's miraculous recovery. However, the Burpos are unprepared for what happens next... Colton says that during his surgery he went to heaven and back, and tells his parents things that he couldn't possibly know. Can Todd find the courage and conviction to share his son's extraordinary, life-changing experience with the world?","tagline":"Unlock the mystery"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6xHcVi6E9DXnfGACGM22baXQ2O7.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/11eRKCIIkRnGseeIlWlAqkbiHKl.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":236751,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6xHcVi6E9DXnfGACGM22baXQ2O7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6xHcVi6E9DXnfGACGM22baXQ2O7.jpg","language":"it","width":768,"height":1024},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6xHcVi6E9DXnfGACGM22baXQ2O7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6xHcVi6E9DXnfGACGM22baXQ2O7.jpg","language":"it","width":768,"height":1024},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aHLwccuwCKAET6QlH72lshgJ1i7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aHLwccuwCKAET6QlH72lshgJ1i7.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tsFovEJuZHVgpvFTHXb37l7ma4F.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tsFovEJuZHVgpvFTHXb37l7ma4F.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/orig